            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/conflicts",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["conflicts"]
            },
            "description": "Register a new conflict record in the database.\n\n**Access:** 🔒 Private — requires `Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}`\n\n**Required fields:**\n- `conflictName` (string)\n- `region` (string)\n- `startYear` (number)\n- `status` (string: `Ongoing` | `Resolved`)\n- `primaryCountry` (string)\n\n**Optional fields:**\n- `endYear`, `gdpChange`, `inflationRate`, `warCostUsd`, `reconstructionCostUsd`, `unemploymentChange`, `povertyRateChange`, `blackMarketIndex`, `description`, `conflictType`\n\n> ⚡ The test script auto-saves the new record's `_id` to `conflict_id`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
